{"dir": "e2c", "line": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "method": "message", "params": {"channel": "text", "window": 4, "attr": 0, "text": "It is written in the Book of Crom:"}}}
{"dir": "e2c", "line": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "method": "message", "params": {"channel": "text", "window": 4, "attr": 0, "text": ""}}}
{"dir": "e2c", "line": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "method": "message", "params": {"channel": "text", "window": 4, "attr": 0, "text": "    After the Creation, the cruel god Moloch rebelled"}}}
{"dir": "e2c", "line": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "method": "message", "params": {"channel": "text", "window": 4, "attr": 0, "text": "    against the authority of Marduk the Creator."}}}
{"dir": "e2c", "line": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "method": "message", "params": {"channel": "text", "window": 4, "attr": 0, "text": "    Moloch stole from Marduk the most powerful of all"}}}
{"dir": "e2c", "line": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "method": "message", "params": {"channel": "text", "window": 4, "attr": 0, "text": "    the artifacts of the gods, the Amulet of Yendor,"}}}
{"dir": "e2c", "line": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "method": "message", "params": {"channel": "text", "window": 4, "attr": 0, "text": "    and he hid it in the dark cavities of Gehennom, the"}}}
{"dir": "e2c", "line": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "method": "message", "params": {"channel": "text", "window": 4, "attr": 0, "text": "    Under World, where he now lurks, and bides his time."}}}
{"dir": "e2c", "line": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "method": "message", "params": {"channel": "text", "window": 4, "attr": 0, "text": ""}}}
{"dir": "e2c", "line": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "method": "message", "params": {"channel": "text", "window": 4, "attr": 0, "text": "Your god Crom seeks to possess the Amulet, and with it"}}}
{"dir": "e2c", "line": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "method": "message", "params": {"channel": "text", "window": 4, "attr": 0, "text": "to gain deserved ascendance over the other gods."}}}
{"dir": "e2c", "line": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "method": "message", "params": {"channel": "text", "window": 4, "attr": 0, "text": ""}}}
{"dir": "e2c", "line": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "method": "message", "params": {"channel": "text", "window": 4, "attr": 0, "text": "You, a newly trained Plunderer, have been heralded"}}}
{"dir": "e2c", "line": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "method": "message", "params": {"channel": "text", "window": 4, "attr": 0, "text": "from birth as the instrument of Crom.  You are destined"}}}
{"dir": "e2c", "line": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "method": "message", "params": {"channel": "text", "window": 4, "attr": 0, "text": "to recover the Amulet for your deity, or die in the"}}}
{"dir": "e2c", "line": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "method": "message", "params": {"channel": "text", "window": 4, "attr": 0, "text": "attempt.  Your hour of destiny has come.  For the sake"}}}
{"dir": "e2c", "line": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "method": "message", "params": {"channel": "text", "window": 4, "attr": 0, "text": "of us all:  Go bravely with Crom!"}}}
{"dir": "e2c", "line": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "method": "window_display", "params": {"window": 4, "blocking": true}}}
